        - Bit 5 (TCC): Type of Coordinate Conversion (0=Radar plane, 1=Sensor to local)
        - Bits 4-2 (spare): Spare bits, set to 0
        - Bit 1 (FX): Extension Indicator (0=End, 1=Extension follows)
      </xs:documentation>
